# Name-level scope for THIS assignment. One domain per line.
# Copy nftables/profiles/_template to nftables/profiles/<engagement>/ first.
#
# Rendered into proxy/squid.conf as `acl scope_domains dstdomain .<name>` by
#   ./scripts/render-squid-scope.sh --profile <engagement>
# A leading dot is added for you; no scheme, no path, no wildcard.
#
# This list names the client. It is engagement-confidential in the same way
# scope.allow is, and it is gitignored for that reason.
#
# EMPTY IS THE DEFAULT AND MEANS DENY: no names, no name-level reach.
#
# Example (replace):
# client.example        # apex + www — client scope doc §1
# docs.client.example   # GitBook-backed docs, CNAME to Cloudflare
